1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:05,470
Most of your customers know their
next plan. You just can't see it yet.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,700
The good news? They leave
a trail in your data:

3
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:11,420
a plan to buy a car,
a renovation coming up,

4
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:14,630
a family about to grow,
or a move to a new neighbourhood.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,770
Seekridge combines transactions,
market data, AI conversations,

6
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:20,860
mortgage and client data, and more,

7
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:23,530
to find the right moment
for you to engage.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,650
This customer's family is growing.
In most cases, that means moving home.

9
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:33,630
It's your moment to act, with
a mortgage offer at the right time.

10
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:38,920
This one is about to buy a car. Offer your
car loan before the dealer does.

11
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:44,620
Another is planning an energy
renovation. Time to offer a green loan.

12
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:50,600
And this one is moving savings out.
Call before the balance shows it.

13
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,700
Every Monday, the week's moments
arrive ranked in your CRM,

14
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:57,770
ready for your advisors to act on.

